ent-ActionDisposalPipeCrawler = Crawl Through Pipes
    .desc = Slip into disposal pipes while you are already inside a disposal unit.
disposal-pipe-crawler-blocked-outer-clothing = Your outer clothing prevents you from squeezing into the pipes.
disposal-pipe-crawler-exit-no-disposal-unit = There is no suitable disposal unit here to exit into.
disposal-pipe-crawler-exit-blocked = The exit into the disposal unit is blocked.
disposal-pipe-crawler-unequip-external = You cannot strip someone else or be stripped while inside a pipe.
disposal-pipe-crawler-unequip-hands-full = Free a hand first, or the removed item would fall out of the pipe.
disposal-pipe-crawler-unequip-dependent = Remove equipment attached over this item first.
